__pycache__/
*.pyc
report.json
report.html
*-report.json
*-report.html
reports/
demo-failing-site.json
demo-failing-site.html
.claude/settings.local.json
.DS_Store
dev/_branch_sweep_*/
.coverage
htmlcov/
dev/notes-*.md

# Exported reports, which must never be committed - but the pattern above
# swallowed dev/mutations/from-a-real-report.json, a mutation set named
# after the report it came from. Four mutations existed on one machine
# only, and the repository claimed 416 while a clone had 412.
!dev/mutations/*.json
